OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer has given children a
OL,4,A'love of surfing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have said a volunteer has given
OL,7,Ftheir daughter and other children "a
OL,8,Flove of surfing".
OL,10,FMichelle Dawson gives up her time to
OL,11,Fhelp run Jersey Surfboard Club and its
OL,12,Facademy at St Ouen's Bay and has helped
OL,13,Fhundreds of children get into the
OL,14,Fsport.
OL,16,FThat includes Nick and Rebecca Dodds'
OL,17,Fdaughter who attended the club with her
OL,18,Fschool friends.
OL,20,FDawson has been nominated for the BBC
OL,21,FRadio Jersey Make a Difference Awards
OL,22,Ffor her work.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
